==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'noir]] spawns as the boss.
**100 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
**50 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
**25 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazer]], [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] and ranged units can make this stage easy. Use [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rushers]] to destroy the base quickly and ensure that you get all of the rewards. If you have [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]], this stage is even easier.

